{"subject":"Congrats on the May enterprise pilot","body":"Congratulations on May's enterprise pilot with a Fortune 500 manufacturer's EMEA finance team. Going from general availability in February to an enterprise pilot within a few months is real progress, and "month-end close in a day" is a sharp way to put it.

If it would be useful, I'd welcome a 20-minute call to hear what you're learning from the pilot and how you're thinking about the next stretch. Happy to work around your schedule.

Dana"}
